                        "snippet": "An overview of the pharmacological effects of major bioactive constituents of Bacopa monnieri.. Among various medicinal Ayurvedic herbs, Bacopa monnieri is considered a herb of grace and commonly known as Brahmi, belonging to the family Scrophulariaceae. It is a small creeping herb with numerous branches, small oblong leaves, and light purple flowers found throughout the Indian subcontinent in ...",
