                    {
                        "id": "https://api.bing.microsoft.com/api/v7/#WebPages.15",
                        "name": "Learn to Grow and Care for Black Eyed Susan Flowers (Rudbeckia hirta ...",
                        "url": "https://www.gardeningchannel.com/black-eyed-susan-flowers-care/",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningchannel.com/black-eyed-susan-flowers-care",
                        "snippet": "Here\u2019s what you should know when you\u2019re trying to learn to grow and care for black-eyed Susan flowers: Growing Conditions for Black-Eyed Susan Flowers. Black-eyed Susan flowers (Rudbeckia hirta) are native to woodland and prairie areas in North America. These flowers are usually perennial and remain hardy in planting zones four through nine.",
