                        "snippet": "\u2018Burning Hearts\u2019 Fern-Leaved Bleeding Heart Dicentra formosa. Zones: 3-9. Exposure: Partial shade, full sun in cooler climates. Height/Spread: 8 to 10 inches tall, 12 to 18 inches wide. Bloom Time: Late spring to mid-summer. Color: Red flowers. This fern-leaf bleeding heart makes a nice addition to mixed containers with its bright red flowers.",
