                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://hort.extension.wisc.edu/articles/bleeding-heart-dicentra-spectabilis",
                        "snippet": "Bleeding heart flowers. The unique 1-2 inch long, delicate-looking pendant flowers are vaguely heart-shaped. Each puffy bloom has two rose-pink outer petals and two white inner petals, with a white stamen protruding from the bottom. The pouched outer petals have strongly reflexed tips from which the inner petals protrude slightly.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-04T18:15:00.0000000Z",
