                        "displayUrl": "https://www.provenwinners.com/plants/dicentra/gold-heart-old-fashioned-bleeding-heart...",
                        "snippet": "This woodland perennial likes rich, loose soil that is evenly moist but also well-drained. At planting time, add lots of compost, humus, or peat moss to the soil to enhance its water retention capabilities. Do not plant in clay soils. Protect from high winds and early frosts. 'Gold Heart' Dicentra spectabilis. 1 Review.",
