                        "snippet": "Blue anise sage is an herbaceous perennial in the Lamiaceae (mint) family that grows up to 5 feet in height and width. It is native to Brazil, Paraguay, Uruguay, and Argentina. The genus name Salvia is derived from the Latin term salveo, which means \u2018be well\u2019 and refers to the plant's medicinal properties.",
