                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/edible/herbs/sage/types-of-sage-plants.htm",
                        "snippet": "Types of Sage Plants There are many different types of sage or salvia plants available. They may be either perennial or annual, blooming to non-blooming, but pretty much each of these different types of sage is fairly hardy. Foliage comes in sage green, variegated purple/green, or variegated gold and blossoms range from lavender to bright blue to cheery red. With so many varieties of sage ...",
