                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/growing-cannas-1402837",
                        "snippet": "Potting and Repotting Canna Lily . Canna lily grown in a pot will need rich potting soil and good drainage. Adding pebbles at the bottom of a pot with ample drainage holes is recommended. The pot itself should be rather large, at least 12 inches in diameter, and made of any medium as long as the aforementioned drainage holes are abundant.",
