                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Jan 12, 2024",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://florgeous.com/canna-lily",
                        "snippet": "The most common variety of canna lily we grow in our gardens is Canna indica, sometimes called achira in Latin America. There are also Canna glauca varieties as well as combinations of the two. These flowers are native to tropical and subtropical regions of the Americas and have become naturalized in most places.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-04T06:56:00.0000000Z",
