                        "displayUrl": "https://garvillo.com/canna-lily-types",
                        "snippet": "Canna Lily \u2018Pretoria,\u2019 also known as Canna Lily \u2018Bengal Tiger\u2019 or Canna Lily \u2018Erebus,\u2019 is a stunning variety that features large, tropical-looking leaves adorned with bold stripes of green and yellow. The foliage alone makes this canna lily a standout in any garden or landscape. The leaves can reach a height of 4 to 6 feet, creating ...",
