                        "snippet": "In the late summer and fall, move potted plants indoors or use an insulating cover when temperatures dip into the 50s. Keep indoor plants away from air conditioner vents and drafts. If the air in your home is dry, use a humidifier to keep it at a minimum of 50% (between 50% and 70% humidity is ideal for coleus).",
