                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://botany-world.com/coleus-plant-profile",
                        "snippet": "Coleus is a genus of flowering tender perennials native to Malaysia and South East Asia. Its multicoloured, decorative foliage makes it a popular garden and houseplant. Coleus is a member of the mint family and has traditional square stems, sweetly scented tubular flowers and oval-shaped leaves with crenate or lobate margins.",
