                        "displayUrl": "https://www.provenwinners.com/how-plant/coleus",
                        "snippet": "See more foliage plants for shade. Follow these growing tips and space 1-2\u2019 apart, depending on the variety: Loosen soil in the planting area to a depth of 6-12\u201d. Remove plant from the nursery pot and loosen roots if potbound. Set plant in the hole with the top of the root ball level with the surrounding soil.",
