                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coleus",
                        "snippet": "Cultivar of Coleus scutellarioides. Coleus (/ \u02c8 k o\u028a l i \u0259 s /, KOH-lee-\u0259s) is a genus of annual or perennial herbs or shrubs, sometimes succulent, sometimes with a fleshy or tuberous rootstock, found in the Afro-Eurasia tropics and subtropics.. The relationship among the genera Coleus, Solenostemon and Plectranthus has been confused. Coleus and Solenostemon were sunk into Plectranthus ...",
