                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Sep 28, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.epicgardening.com/coleus-varieties",
                        "snippet": "Coleus are actually a botanist\u2019s nightmare, they keep changing species and the nomenclature changes and species are split up based on miniscule scientific properties. But let\u2019s leave that for them to figure out. For a gardener there are almost 300 species of coleus, and over 1500 different varieties. I will barely be scratching the surface ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-05T06:13:00.0000000Z",
                        "primaryImageOfPage": {
