                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.provenwinners.com/plants/coleus/colorblaze-wicked-witch-coleus-scutellarioides",
                        "snippet": "3. Treat for disease and insects before bringing plants indoors. 4. Place in bright areas and add humidity using pebble trays or spray bottles. 5. Be careful not to over water. 6 When active growth starts in spring fertilize and prune as needed. 7. Introduce your plants slowly to outdoor conditions in spring.",
