                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/foliage/coleus/coleus-plant-care.htm",
                        "snippet": "Propagation. You can easily grow and propagate coleus by cutting. Cut several inches off the top of a plant and remove leaves from the bottom half of the stem. Root the cutting in water. They can also be propagated by seed indoors about eight to ten weeks prior to your last expected spring frost. Repotting.",
