                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://garden.org/ideas/view/goldfinch4/231/All-About-Coleus",
                        "snippet": "Coleus can be used in your gardens, containers, patio gardens, flower arrangements or even as a houseplant. They can be trailing plants or bushy mounds. The leaves can be lacy, ruffled, smooth, twisted, solid colors, have contrasting edges, or a kaleidoscope of colors, big, little, round, pointed. In other words, something for everyone!",
