                        "snippet": "Common Name (s): Zinnia or common zinnia is an erect, flowering annual in the Asteraceae (aster) family with Mexican origins. It is a garden favorite, and many cultivars are available. In the past zinnias were used primarily as cut flowers, but now they are seen more often in home landscapes in a variety of colors.",
