                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Feb 6, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenbeast.com/zinnia-elegans-guide",
                        "snippet": "This seed mix features pom-pom like blossoms which comes in shades of white, orange, red, purple, pink, and salmon. Plant 2-3 zinnia flower seeds \u00bc\u201d in deep every few inches in fertile, well-draining soil in full sun. Once the seedlings have 4 leaves, thin them out to 1 every 8-18\u201d apart. Will grow to 24\" in height.",
