                        "snippet": "Keep the soil moist and warm, and the seeds should germinate in 5-10 days. Once the seedlings have grown a few inches tall, thin them out to about 6-18 inches apart (15-45 cm). Cutting propagation: Take a cutting from a healthy zinnia plant by cutting a stem that is about 4-6 inches long (10-15 cm).",
