                        "snippet": "Coral Bells (Heuchera) Care tips. Plant it in the shade or semi-shade. Use well-drained soil with a pH of 5.5-7.0. Water when the soil is 1.5 to 2 inches dry. Apply a slow-release fertilizer in March-April. Spray the plant with a fungicide to get rid of the disease. Remove dead leaves in spring. Use horticultural oil to protect the plant from ...",
