                                "snippet": "According to those growing Mexican zinnias, these plants get 12 to 18 inches (30.5 to 45.5 cm.) tall. You\u2019ll want to plant them about 12 inches (30.5 cm.) apart to give them ample room to develop."
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "Creeping Zinnia In The Garden",
