                        "snippet": "Cock\u2019s comb, also known as rooster\u2019s comb, cockscomb, brain celosia, wool flower, and botanically known as celosia, is a flowering herb belonging to the amaranth family. Cock\u2019s comb flowers come out as compacted crest heads on leafy stems. The plant starts blooming in summer and keeps on till late fall. Cock\u2019s comb flowers come forth in ...",
