                                "snippet": "mis-KAN-thus sih-NEN-sis Audio. This beautiful grass has an \u201cinner light\u201d that emanates from the white midribs of its fine-textured leaf blades and the threads of white around their edges. Forming a graceful shape usually between 5 and 6 feet tall, \u2018Morning Light\u2019 turns golden in November and fades to beige in winter."
