                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.monrovia.com/avalanche-feather-reed-grass.html",
                        "snippet": "Create stunning vertical effects with feathery stalks that emerge reddish brown in spring, then turn golden in fall. Stiff, variegated foliage with white centers and green margins forms a dense, narrow clump. Excellent for use as a landscape accent or a very dramatic mass planting. Plumes are an attractive addition to cut flower arrangements.",
