                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://plants.ces.ncsu.edu/plants/achillea-filipendulina",
                        "snippet": "This perennial does well in full sun in average well-drained soils. Do not over-fertilize or water. It is heat, humidity and drought tolerant. Fernleaf yarrow will grow 3-4 feet tall and 2-3 feet wide and does best in an area protected from winds. Divide as needed to prevent spread and overcrowding. Deadhead to promote additional blooms.",
