                        "name": "Achillea Yarrow Fernleaf Parker Drought Resistant Garden ... - Outsidepride",
                        "url": "https://www.outsidepride.com/seed/flower-seed/yarrow/yarrow-parker-flower-seed.html",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.outsidepride.com/seed/flower-seed/yarrow/yarrow-parker-flower-seed.html",
                        "snippet": "Yarrow is a perennial, upright drought tolerant plant that blooms from spring until fall. The flower heads are 3 - 4 inches wide, the Yarrow plants spread 18 - 24 inches and reach 24 inches in height. Yarrow Summer Pastels make a great addition to any perennial xeriscape garden for mass plantings, borders, naturalized settings and cottage gardens.",
