                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://harvesttotable.com/how-to-grow-yarrow-achillea",
                        "snippet": "Achillea\u2013commonly called yarrow\u2013is a colorful addition to the garden. Yarrow has fernlike, fragrant leaves. Species and cultivars range in size from very small, creeping plants to very large\u2014up to 4 feet (1.2m) tall. Achillea is easy to grow and grows well even in poor, dry soil. Achillea is a perennial. It is also known as milfoil and ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-04T17:06:00.0000000Z",
