                        "snippet": "If grown from seed, flowering cabbages and kales can take from 75 to 90 days to mature. They should be planted 12 to 15 inches apart and grow 12 to 18 inches tall. Plant them in full sun or in part shade with protection from harsh afternoon sun. When planting, amend soil with organic compost.",
