                        "snippet": "How to plant: Choose a site with at least 6 to 8 hours of direct sun and well-draining soil. Follow these steps and space plants 1 to 4 feet apart, depending on the variety. Loosen the soil in the planting area to improve drainage. Dig a hole twice as wide and slightly deeper than the root ball.",
