                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/foliage/fountain-grass/red-fountain-grass.htm",
                        "snippet": "Red fountain ornamental grass (Pennisetum setaceum \u2018Rubrum\u2019) is a showy, clump forming grass with burgundy red leaves and feathery plumes of rosy purple blooms.You may know this attention grabber as crimson fountain grass. Although many types of fountain grass are invasive, this plant is well behaved and seldom sets seed. You can expect the plant to reach mature heights of about three to ...",
