                        "snippet": "This shrub will form a low colony and grows in dreadful soils that other plants would find intolerable. The fall color is a vibrant red to orange, and birds flock to the clusters of red, fuzzy berries. Return to Plant Search Home. Height: 3-7 ft. Spread: 4-6 ft. Hardiness Zone: 4-9. Bloom Color: Insignificant.",
