                        "snippet": "Fragrant Sumac (Rhus aromatica) Fragrant Sumac. Cashew family (Anacardiaceae) Description: This woody shrub is 2-8' tall. Depending on the variety, it is variable in size and branching habit. Fragrant Sumac can be an erect shrub with ascending branches, or it can be a low shrub with spreading branches. The trunk and lower branches are greyish ...",
