                        "snippet": "A Johnson\u2019s Nursery origination, J.N. Plant Selections introduction, Lacette\u2122 Fragrant Sumac was selected for its dense, mounded habit and refined textured foliage. This shrub lends an air of sophistication to sites where few other plants will grow. The aromatic leaves are glossy green during summer, turning brilliant shades of red in fall.",
