                        "snippet": "The garden uses for these plants are plenty and wide. Dicentra are used in shaded borders along with houses and walkways. Other uses include planting fringed bleeding heart with other flowering perennials in rock gardens, woodland gardens, wildflower gardens, and naturalized areas. 11. Join 13,000+ Plant Lovers.",
