                        "displayUrl": "https://davesgarden.com/guides/pf/go/192",
                        "snippet": "From seed; winter sow in vented containers, coldframe or unheated greenhouse. From seed; stratify if sowing indoors. Seed Collecting. Bag seedheads to capture ripening seed. Allow pods to dry on plant; break open to collect seeds. Regional. This plant is said to grow outdoors in the following regions: Auburn, Alabama.",
