                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningchannel.com/impatiens-flowers-growing-and-care",
                        "snippet": "In the germination phase, impatiens is prone to damping off, so plant plenty of extra seeds in case this happens. Some plant viruses affect impatiens, but these are difficult to prevent or fight, beyond ensuring you buy seeds, seedlings and plants from reputable nurseries, and keeping your garden tools and containers scrupulously clean.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-05T06:06:00.0000000Z",
