                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardenista.com/garden-design-101/perennials/verbena",
                        "snippet": "Growing Verbena: Tips at a Glance. Verbena will be a faithful garden companion with purple, pink, or white flowers if you plant this tender perennial in a sunny spot in USDA growing zones 7 to 10. In colder climates, use it in containers (moss verbenas will creep over the edges of a pot) or as an annual bedding plant. Type Herbaceous flower.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-02T02:47:00.0000000Z",
                        "cachedPageUrl": "http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Garden+Verbena+(biology+OR+information+OR+botany+OR+scientific)+-blog+-shopping&d=4642370153152640&mkt=en-US&setlang=en-US&w=vxFSvuF1xyc_Gxl_qCeJUPFCXotHWU55",
