                        "snippet": "This herbaceous groundcover can grow to 3\u2019 in height and 3\u2019 in width. It bears narrowly oval pointed leaves which are mid-green above, pale green beneath. Tiny saucer-shaped white blossoms are produced in dense, tapered terminal racemes (in the form of spikes). The flowers are 4\u201d-8\u201d long. Flowering occurs during mid to late summer.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-28T20:40:00.0000000Z",
