                        "snippet": "As with many members of the Orchid Family, over collection by plant enthusiasts is a major problem for the Grass-pink. Unregulated and unscrupulous collectors have wiped out more than one species of orchid. Additionally, this plant prefers to grow in moist areas, like bogs, wet meadows, seepage slopes and moist savannahs. ...",
