                        "displayUrl": "https://www.planetnatural.com/hakone-grass",
                        "snippet": "Planting Hakone Grass. Plant your Hakone grass in early spring to give it a head start and establish a strong root system before winter. Here\u2019s how to do it: Dig a roomy hole. Make it twice as broad as the root ball and a bit shallower than its height. This gives the roots space to spread comfortably. Place your Japanese forest grass in the hole.",
