                        "snippet": "Hakone grass is a graceful ornamental grass that thrives in shaded environments. Key care points include: ensuring the plant receives consistent moisture without waterlogging, and providing well-draining, humus-rich soil. Additionally, protect hakone grass from harsh, direct sunlight to prevent leaf scorch. Regularly trim dead foliage to maintain its appearance and health.",
