                        "snippet": "Noteworthy Characteristics. Hosta sieboldii 'Kabitan' features a mound of ruffled, narrow, variegated leaves with gold centers and green edges with racemes of dark lavender flowers on 20\" scapes. A dependable and versatile perennial requiring little care. Grown primarily for its beautiful foliage which provides color, contrast and texture to the landscape.",
