                        "snippet": "The Arendsii is a family of hybrid Astilbe. Most varieties of Arendsii prefer moist, well-drained soil. And they grow from 2 to 4 feet tall. Although mostly shade hardy, some Arendsii can tolerate full sun as long as their soil remains moist and the climate is not too hot.Arendsii bloom from late spring to early fall depending on the variety.. Japanese Astilbe",
