                        "displayUrl": "https://www.waltersgardens.com/variety.php?ID=ASBBV",
                        "snippet": "Astilbe. 'Bridal Veil'. A member of Astilbe x arendsii (Hybrid Astilbe/False Spirea). A group of hybrids developed by famed German nurseryman George Arends. Includes crosses between A. chinensis var. davidii with A. astilboides, A. japonica, and A. thunbergii. The resulting hybrids comprise over 95% of all Astilbe sold in the USA.",
