                        "snippet": "Here's how to propagate pansies through division. Lift old plants gently about 6 weeks before the first frost. Break the plants into clumps ensuring each plant retains a bit of new growth and some root. Use a coldframe to strengthen them for 3 to 4 weeks. Move them to the spots where they will be permanently planted.",
