                        "displayUrl": "https://plantcaretoday.com/pansies-viola-flower.html",
                        "snippet": "Some have darker centers (faces) like hybrid pansies. All of these are smaller than pansies and grow in attractive mounds in the garden. They flower continuously throughout the growing season. Skippy XL Red-Gold is an exception among violas. This hardy, prize winning hybrid produces flowers that are nearly as large as those of a hybrid pansy.",
