                        "name": "Indiangrass - Simple English Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia",
                        "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indiangrass",
                        "thumbnailUrl": "https://www.bing.com/th?id=OIP.mIw-oaualzEz6sglhaFStgAAAA&w=80&h=80&c=1&pid=5.1",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indiangrass",
                        "snippet": "Indiangrass. Andropogon avenaceus Michx. Andropogon nutans var. avenaceus (Michx.) Hack. Chrysopogon avenaceus (Michx.) Benth. Sorghastrum avenaceum (Michx.) Nash. Indiangrass (Sorghastrum nutans), also called Indian grass, is a North American prairie grass, and is the official state grass of both Oklahoma and South Carolina.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-02T02:06:00.0000000Z",
                        "primaryImageOfPage": {
                            "thumbnailUrl": "https://www.bing.com/th?id=OIP.mIw-oaualzEz6sglhaFStgAAAA&w=80&h=80&c=1&pid=5.1",
