                        "snippet": "Moderate humidity levels of 40% \u2013 50% percent are perfect for ivy geraniums, but too much humidity or warm humidity can lead to fungal infections. South Africa is a temperate nation, and your ivy geranium is thus rather heat-sensitive. Avoid temperatures above 80\u00b0 degrees Fahrenheit. When possible, it prefers daytime temperatures of 65\u00b0 to ...",
