                        "name": "Japanese Tree Lilac: Snowdance, Ivory Silk and Copper Curls",
                        "description": "If you are looking for prolific white blooms on a small tree, look no further than Japanese Tree Lilac. We\u2019ll look at Snowdance, Ivory Silk and Copper Curls. This small tree form lilac is perfect for any landscape and is known for its extremely hardy nature. Mountain Frost Pear and Spring Snow Crabapple are also mentioned.",
