                        "snippet": "Water regularly, especially during dry spells, but avoid waterlogging. Pruning: After the first bloom, prune back the plant by one-third to encourage a second bloom. This also helps maintain the plant\u2019s shape and vigor. Propagation: Lady\u2019s Mantle self-seeds readily. If you want to control its spread, deadhead the flowers before they set seed.",
