                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenfrontier.com/ladys-mantle",
                        "snippet": "Lady\u2019s Mantle is a perennial herbaceous plant from the Rosaceae family. It\u2019s native to Europe and Asia but has since been naturalized in North America. The plant typically grows to 1-2 to 2 feet tall and produces delicate, yellow-green flowers that bloom from late spring to early summer. One of the most distinctive features of Lady\u2019s ...",
