                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenbeast.com/alchemilla-mollis-guide",
                        "snippet": "Also known as alchemilla mollis. Lady's mantle has beautiful yellow flowers. Sow alchemilla mollis at 2 - 3 seeds per plant indoors 6 - 8 weeks before the last frost is expected. Press the seeds into the soil and cover no more than 1/8 inch with soil. Keep the seeds moist and maintain a temperature between 64 - 72F.",
