                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lilac_(color)",
                        "snippet": "Lilac is a light shade of pink representing the average color of most lilac flowers.The colors of some lilac flowers may be equivalent to the colors shown below as pale lilac, rich lilac, or deep lilac.However, there are other lilac flowers that are colored red-violet.. The first recorded use of the term lilac as an English color name was in 1775. [2]",
