                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardenersworld.com/how-to/grow-plants/how-to-grow-lilac",
                        "snippet": "Dig a generous hole and plant your lilac to the level of the soil line. Back-fill and firm down the soil gently around the plant. Water in well. Mulch after planting to help retain moisture in the soil. If you're growing lilac in a pot, choose one that is at least 60cm in diameter.",
