                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.monrovia.com/common-purple-lilac.html",
                        "snippet": "Common Purple Lilac. Syringa vulgaris. Pronunciation: sih-REEN-gah vul-GAIR-iss. SKU #40689. USDA Zone. 3-8. Your climate might be too cold for this plant: Change Location. Abundant clusters of sweetly fragrant, purple flowers in mid-spring on a vigorous, upright, multi-stemmed shrub with heart-shaped, green foliage. Ideal as a flowering hedge ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-02T04:26:00.0000000Z",
                        "cachedPageUrl": "http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Lilac+(biology+OR+information+OR+botany+OR+scientific)+-blog+-shopping&d=4630288410476840&mkt=en-US&setlang=en-US&w=n_hiZEU_7ZE5nMZu0ssaEbGc0H3tVg6t",
