                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/shrubs/lilac/winterizing-lilac-shrubs.htm",
                        "snippet": "Lilac winter care starts with good siting and a healthy plant. The plant needs at least eight hours of sunshine and alkaline to neutral soil. When choosing a planting location, avoid planting them against a light-colored building or wall, as this can cause winter burn from the reflection. They make a brilliant front of house display and darker ...",
