                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.monrovia.com/little-darling-lilac.html",
                        "snippet": "What's better than a fragrant lilac? One that blooms twice a year! Large clusters of dark-purple buds open to classic lilac-hue flowers. Blooms heavily in spring, with a second, lighter bloom set in fall. Compact, with a nicely rounded shape, perfect for containers and mixed borders. Tolerates mild, periodic drought when established. Deciduous. Monrovia Exclusive.",
