                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardenersworld.com/how-to/grow-plants/how-to-grow-lily-of-the-valley",
                        "snippet": "Step 3. Watering the lily of the valley bulbs. Fill the pot with compost, leaving the shoot just above the surface. Water, then place in a cool greenhouse. Keep watering and plant out once the roots fill the pot. Lily of the valley can suffer if planted into wet soils. Pot new plants in pots first, for the best results.",
