                        "snippet": "Lobelia Giant lobelia (Lobelia deckenii). Lobelia species are annual or perennial herbs or undershrubs, rarely shrubby, although the \u201ctree\u201d lobelias found at high elevations on the mountains of tropical Africa are remarkable arborescent forms. The genus has a great diversity of forms, and species frequently appear dissimilar from each other.",
