                        "snippet": "The genus Lobelia is named for Matthias de Lobel (1538\u20131616), a Flemish physician, botanist and author of a landmark botany textbook. Bay lobelia is often confused with Canadian or blue toadflax (Linaria canadensis), another diminutive wildflower commonly seen en mass along roadsides and with a similar color and flower form.",
