                        "snippet": "Dianthus deltoides \u2018Flashing Lights\u2019 (Maiden Pink) greets the late-spring-to-summer garden with a profusion of fringed scarlet-red blossoms that attract bees and butterflies. This is an easy-to-grow, fragrant evergreen perennial with a creeping habit. This plant delights along a border, in a rock garden, or massed as a groundcover.",
