                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Jul 19, 2024",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/creeping-phlox-plants-2132214",
                        "snippet": "Creeping Phlox Care. Here are the requirements to successfully grow low-maintenance creeping phlox. Water every week or two if you haven't had any rainfall to keep rich, slightly acidic soil moist. Prune mature plants to keep them tidy unless you want them to naturally spread out to blanket an area.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-05T01:59:00.0000000Z",
                        "primaryImageOfPage": {
