                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Aug 17, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenbeast.com/creeping-phlox-guide",
                        "snippet": "As with all annual flowers, annual phlox must be allowed to reseed for a large display the following year. Sow 3 - 4 of these flower seeds per plant, spaced 10 - 12 inches apart. Annual phlox care includes pruning the plant after the first blooms. Pruning encourages a second bloom of the phlox flowers. $7.99.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-31T04:25:00.0000000Z",
