                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.finegardening.com/plant/moss-phlox-phlox-subulata",
                        "snippet": "Moss phlox is a dense ground cover blanketed with notch-petaled flowers in April and May. Blooms can be muddy hot pink, bright rose, and magenta, while other cultivars include white, soft lavender-blue, clear pale pink to deep pink, clear scarlet, and lavender, some with a darker or lighter eye. Evergreen foliage is narrow, short, and stiff.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-29T17:47:00.0000000Z",
                        "primaryImageOfPage": {
