                        "snippet": "Description: Moss Phlox is a vigorous, spreading, mat-forming evergreen perennial. It features red-purple to violet-purple to pink to white flowers, which bloom March-May to create an early spring carpet of color. The best blooms occur in full sun. Use Moss Phlox for edging, cascading walls, and as a groundcover in select areas of your yard.",
