                        "snippet": "Direct sow in spring; this seed germinates best in warm soil. Plant these non-GMO Persian Carpet Zinnia wildflower seeds just below the surface and keep the soil lightly moist until germination, which usually occurs within 7-10 days. Seedlings do not transplant well. Water seedlings regularly until they become established, but do not over water.",
