                        "snippet": "Coughs and Colds. As well as boosting the immune system and helping to prevent coughs, cold and influenza, Tropaeolum majus can act as a natural expectorant. A cup of tea made from nasturtium is an excellent way to get rid of the build-up of mucus that causes coughing and breathing troubles.",
