                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.rxlist.com/supplements/nasturtium.htm",
                        "snippet": "Side Effects. Nasturtium might be safe for adults when applied directly to the skin in combination with other natural medicines. It can cause skin irritation, especially if used for a long time. There isn't enough information to know if nasturtium is safe when taken by mouth. It can cause stomach upset, kidney damage, and other side effects.",
