                        "datePublished": "2023-05-11T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "May 11, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenerspath.com/plants/annuals/grow-ornamental-peppers",
                        "snippet": "To do this, clear the soil of plants and debris, then till or dig up the soil. In the hottest part of the summer, wet the soil thoroughly, and cover the area with a clear plastic tarp. Bury the edges of the tarp to trap the heat. Leave the plastic in place for 4 to 6 weeks, and then remove it.",
