                        "name": "How to Plant, Grow and Care Purslane - The Gardening Life",
                        "url": "https://thegardeninglife.com/grow-purslane/",
                        "thumbnailUrl": "https://www.bing.com/th?id=OIP.QLsoAiNH64hcRJ7NP0dmigHaE8&w=80&h=80&c=1&pid=5.1",
                        "datePublished": "2022-10-11T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Oct 11, 2022",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://thegardeninglife.com/grow-purslane",
                        "snippet": "Keep on reading that what you can do with purslane and how to grow purslane. Whenever we hear about growing purslane, a picture hits the mind of \u201cunwanted weeds.\u201d But gone are those days when Purslane was considered a weed. You must be surprised to know; purslane is super nutritious and delicious.",
