                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/how-to-grow-petunias-1402893",
                        "snippet": "Temperature and Humidity. The ideal temperatures for petunias are roughly 60\u00b0F to 75\u00b0F during the day and 55\u00b0 to 65\u00b0F at night, with low to moderate humidity levels. They tolerate temperatures down to about 40\u00b0F. Frost and freezing temperatures will damage and ultimately kill the plants in the fall.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-05T01:03:00.0000000Z",
                        "cachedPageUrl": "http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Petunia+(biology+OR+information+OR+botany+OR+scientific)+-blog+-shopping&d=5052389210325100&mkt=en-US&setlang=en-US&w=HBCNpS0oVbn5j5T36E5EUYMtyvpP9YAD",
