                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "May 31, 2024",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/flowers/petunia/petunia-care.htm",
                        "snippet": "A little pruning, full sun, and moist, well-drained soil should keep them happy and blooming all summer and into the fall. Light. A petunia will do best in full sun but will tolerate partial shade. Too much shade results in unattractive leggy growth. Water. Petunias prefer medium moisture in the soil.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-05T18:09:00.0000000Z",
