                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://balconygardenweb.com/types-of-petunias-best-varieties",
                        "snippet": "22. Easy Wave Yellow. Size: 6-12 inches. This wave series petunia grows higher than most wave varieties. The beautiful white flowers have deep yellow veins and throat. 23. Shock Wave. Size: 10-12 inches. \u2018Shock Wave\u2019 petunia flowers from late spring to summer in a range of colors from rose, pink.",
