                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardenloversclub.com/ornamental/flowers/petunias/types-of-petunias",
                        "snippet": "Blooms can be pink, purple, white, raspberry, and coral. 9. Petunia \u2018Supertunia Pink Star Charm\u2019. With a height of 10 inches, this is a variation that will look great around the edge of the garden. Red, peach, pink, lavender, yellow, and white are common colors of this plant. Honey is also a color of this that I adore.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-03T01:15:00.0000000Z",
