                        "name": "How to Choose the Right Petunia - The Spruce",
                        "url": "https://www.thespruce.com/how-to-choose-right-petunias-1402928",
                        "thumbnailUrl": "https://www.bing.com/th?id=OIP.shCdneeBLCBRJs73iixd_QHaFj&w=80&h=80&c=1&pid=5.1",
                        "datePublished": "2022-06-23T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Jun 23, 2022",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/how-to-choose-right-petunias-1402928",
                        "snippet": "Supertunias are extremely vigorous growers and bloomers, but they require frequent feeding to stay at their peak. However, if you feed them a little whenever you water them, or at least once a month, they will bloom and bloom. Supertunias are also weather-tolerant. Continue to 5 of 6 below. 05 of 06.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-02T01:19:00.0000000Z",
