                        "snippet": "Their large blossoms attract hummingbirds and butterflies. This year Proven Winners brings two unique Petunias: Giant Pink and Red. Supertunias are a longtime favorite of growers and home gardeners alike. They're virtually maintenance free and bloom continuously throughout the season. Their large blossoms attract hummingbirds and butterflies.",
