                        "displayUrl": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celosia_argentea",
                        "snippet": "Celosia argentea, commonly known as the plumed cockscomb or silver cock's comb, [2] is a herbaceous plant of tropical origin in the family Amaranthaceae [3] from India and Nepal. [4] The plant is known for its very bright colors. In India and China it is known as a troublesome weed. [5]",
