                        "snippet": "To care for celosia plants, grow the tropical plants in full sun to get eight hours of sunlight daily. Plant celosia flowers in well-draining, fertile soil that retains moisture. Water cockscomb plants three or four times weekly during spring and summer. The minimum growing temperature for celosia plants is 60\u00b0F (15\u00b0C).",
