                        "snippet": "Dec 24 2021. Silver Cock's Comb (Celosia argentea 'Asian Garden), also called plumed cockscomb, is an annual herb that can grow to 1m tall. Silver Cock's Comb stem is erect, green or reddish-purple, longitudinally striated. Leaves are alternate, lanceolate or elliptic-lanceolate, 5 -- 9cm long, 1 -- 3cm wide.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-29T01:37:00.0000000Z",
