                        "displayUrl": "https://www.americanmeadows.com/.../perennials/unique-perennials/all-about-red-hot-poker",
                        "snippet": "Red Hot Poker plants can be grow in containers, as well. Select dwarf varieties, such as 'Little Maid'. Keep the container well-watered, and fertilize every 2 weeks with a liquid fertilizer. Red Hot Poker plants can take a light frost, but not a freeze. In cold areas, come fall move your plant into a protected location such as a sunny shed.",
