                        "snippet": "Plant varieties of red hot poker plants that bloom at different times to extend bloom time from early summer to mid fall. Create a tropical-themed border using red hot poker plants in combination with other bold, tropical-looking plants such as banana, canna lilies, elephant ears, lantana, coleus and hibiscus. KNIPHOFIA COMPANION PLANTS:",
