                        "snippet": "A Brief Guide to Caring for Rose Campion Plants. Written by MasterClass. Last updated: Oct 22, 2021 \u2022 3 min read. Known to produce striking foliage and showy flowers, the rose campion plant makes for a great perennial border for any garden.",
