                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.americanmeadows.com/product/perennials/russian-sage-tall",
                        "snippet": "Russian Sage delivers tall, airy spires of lavender-blue color on highly-textured silver-gray foliage to the landscape. A robust plant, Russian Sage performs beautifully in hot, dry climates and is drought tolerant once established. Very attractive to pollinators, find a spot for this beautiful specimen where its gentle colors and loose shape can play a supporting role to bolder perennials ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-29T07:47:00.0000000Z",
