                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/trees/magnolia/saucer-magnolia-trees.htm",
                        "snippet": "Bred by Soulange-Bodin in the 1820s, by 1840 the saucer magnolia was coveted by gardeners around the world and sold for about $8 per seedling, which was a very expensive price for a tree in those days. Today, the saucer magnolia is still one of the most popular trees in the U.S. and Europe. Continue reading for more saucer magnolia information.",
