                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/becky-shasta-daisy-flowers-2132612",
                        "snippet": "Here's how to propagate 'Becky' shasta daisy by division: Gather gloves, a spade shovel, a garden trowel, pruning shears, and compost. In the spring, carefully dig up your 'Becky' shasta daisy plant by breaking up the soil around the root zone (four to six inches around the plant). Shake off as much soil as possible and lay the plant and root ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-04T16:38:00.0000000Z",
