                    {
                        "id": "https://api.bing.microsoft.com/api/v7/#WebPages.15",
                        "name": "Shasta Daisy Flowers: Information On How To Grow Shasta Daisy ...",
                        "url": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/flowers/shasta-daisy/planting-shasta-daisies.htm",
                        "datePublished": "2021-07-26T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Jul 26, 2021",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/ornamental/flowers/shasta-daisy/planting-shasta...",
                        "snippet": "When planting Shasta daisies in the garden, take care to prepare the soil properly. Fertile soil is necessary for the best bloom on Shasta daisy flowers. Good drainage is important for the performance of the Shasta daisy as well. While Shasta daisies will take light shade, as opposed to a full sun location, the plants won't tolerate soggy roots ...",
