                        "snippet": "Step 5: Divide Your Plants. If you\u2019re propagating stonecrop by division, dig up your plant and gently separate the roots into smaller clumps. Make sure each clump has several healthy stems and roots. Replant your new clumps in your prepared soil, making sure they are at the same depth as they were before.",
