                        "snippet": "Noteworthy Characteristics Attractive to bees. Care Grow in full sun and well-drained, neutral to slightly alkaline soil of moderate fertility. Divide every 3 or 4 years. Plants sometime flop late in the season, so stake or cut back by half in early June. Propagation Take stem cuttings in early summer, or root individual leaves in summer.",
