                        "snippet": "Plant your irises 18-24\u201d apart to help with airflow. Watering should be done in the morning so the plant can dry off in the sun. Night watering leaves the plant wet overnight and invites fungal diseases to grow. Remove and dispose of the damaged leaves and rhizomes if you notice iris rot.",
