                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.live-native.com/siebolds-hosta",
                        "snippet": "Planting. Hosta Sieboldiana can be planted in the garden from March until autumn. Tere should be only one plant per square meter (10 sq ft.). The Siebold\u2019s hosta can get very old and will become more and more beautiful over the years if you let it grow undisturbed. For this it needs enough space right from the start.",
