                        "snippet": "Care Grow in moist but well-drained, fertile soil. Shade tolerant. Grows best with full morning sun. Tolerates drought, but a summer mulch is beneficial. Propagation Divide plants in late summer or early spring. Problems Slugs, snails, viruses, foliar nematodes. In containers, watch for vine weevils. Genus : Hosta.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-31T06:58:00.0000000Z",
                        "primaryImageOfPage": {
