                        "siteName": "Garden For Indoor"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "https://api.bing.microsoft.com/api/v7/#WebPages.11",
                        "name": "Blue Hostas: How To Plant, Grow, and Care For These Popular Perennials",
                        "url": "https://www.epicgardening.com/blue-hosta/",
                        "datePublished": "2023-10-05T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Oct 5, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.epicgardening.com/blue-hosta",
                        "snippet": "Today, most garden hosta varieties can be traced back to wild Japanese landscapes. From Japan, hostas were introduced to Europe by Philipp Franz von Siebold. A doctor and botanist, Siebold studied Japanese flora and fauna in the early 19 th century. Expelled from Japan in 1829 for possessing maps of the territory, he brought over 10 000 ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-04T18:31:00.0000000Z",
                        "cachedPageUrl": "http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Siebold+Hosta+(biology+OR+information+OR+botany+OR+scientific)+-blog+-shopping&d=4936133033328762&mkt=en-US&setlang=en-US&w=prqTLiMnr3nEsZ7hsOeMr6FJPL60OwVT",
                        "language": "en",
