                        "snippet": "Here are thirteen of the top viburnum shrub varieties to plant in your landscape: 1. Arrowwood Viburnum (Viburnum Dentatum) Arrowwood viburnum is a hardy viburnum shrub variety native to the eastern united states. This viburnum survives in a wide range of conditions; these include varying soil types and sun exposure.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-03T03:28:00.0000000Z",
                        "cachedPageUrl": "http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Siebold+viburnum+(biology+OR+information+OR+botany+OR+scientific)+-blog+-shopping&d=4716733218947332&mkt=en-US&setlang=en-US&w=7mvN9tU0_nBg7BysVeG4FvEn35EMM8Rc",
