                        "snippet": "Width: 4 to 5 ft. Common characteristics: Cotinus spp. is a multi-stemmed, deciduous shrub native to central China and Europe. The smoke tree is a unique delight. It features large, fluffy, plume-like stalks with many small flowers, giving the appearance of pink smoke. The actual flowers are tiny and not showy.",
