                        "snippet": "Spicebush twigs are also added to steam baths to promote sweating, which, in turn, helps to alleviate body aches and pains. Culinary uses. Native Americans used dried fruits as a spice and the leaves for tea. Young leaves, twigs and fruit contain an aromatic essential oil and make a very fragrant tea.",
