                        "snippet": "Cleome is a genus in Cleomaceae (spider flower) family. This genus contains over 100 species and many cultivars. Cleome is a tall garden plant that can reach 6 feet tall but dwarf varieties are available making it useful for smaller gardens. In most areas it is grown as an annual, it grows quickly from seed and blooms all summer until frost.",
