                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://ohiodnr.gov/discover-and-learn/plants-trees/broad-leaf-trees/sugar-maple-acer...",
                        "snippet": "Sugar Maple (Acer saccharum) is a favorite shade tree with reliable fall color, found in the forests and meadows throughout all of Ohio, but flourishing in the cooler climates and more acidic soils of northeastern Ohio and Appalachia. It is valued for its hard, dense, fine-grained and difficult-to-split wood, which is utilized for floors ...",
