                        "snippet": "Data show consuming sunflower and other seeds may lower rates of heart disease, high blood pressure, and high cholesterol. Energy: Thanks to vitamin B, selenium, and protein, sunflower seeds can help energize you throughout the day. These nutrients support blood flow, deliver oxygen throughout the body, and convert food into energy.",
