                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://wikifarmer.com/en/sunflower-history-uses-and-plant-information",
                        "snippet": "Sunflower Plant information. The cultivated sunflower (Helianthus annuus L.) is one of the 67 species in the genus Helianthus. Most species of the genus are perennial plants, while only a few are annuals. All the species belong to the Asteraceae (Compositae) family. The plant has a typical composite flower that follows the sun\u2019s route.",
