                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.thespruce.com/how-to-grow-sweet-alyssum-1402862",
                        "snippet": "Here are the main care requirements for growing sweet alyssum: Plant in well-draining soil. Place in an area with full sun, but that also allows for shade. Provide your sweet alyssum plants with an inch of water every week, and water more when the climate becomes dry. Deadhead the plant to encourage more blooms.",
