                        "snippet": "Sweet Alyssum Care. Light. If you\u2019d like to plant alyssum in your garden you should first consider their light needs. Alyssum grows best where it can receive ample sun throughout the day. However, when grown in regions that are especially hot, alyssum generally benefits from afternoon or part-shade conditions.",
