                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://www.gardendesign.com/annuals/alyssum.html",
                        "snippet": "How to plant: Broadcast alyssum seed in flats indoors, or well-amended soil outside. Don\u2019t cover seed, as light will aid in germination. Keep moist until germination, 7-20 days. Transplant seedlings when there are at least two sets of secondary leaves, allowing 6 inches of space between plants.",
