                        "snippet": "Here\u2019s how: To propagate by seed, let the pollinated flower mature and dry completely on the plant. Once dried, snip the seedhead off your Moonbeam coreopsis plant. Crush the seed head over a paper plate to release the seeds, and let them dry in a dark, cool environment for a week. Store in a paper envelope.",
