                        "snippet": "Solomon's Seal Care. Here are the main care requirements for growing Solomon's seal in your garden. Plant Solomon's seal in partial or full shade. Use rich, slightly acidic soil for Solomon's seal plants. Keep the soil around Solomon's seal moist but not overly saturated. The Spruce / Grant Webster.",
