                        "displayUrl": "https://www.finegardening.com/plant/variegated-fragrant-solomons-seal-polygonatum...",
                        "snippet": "Variegated Solomon\u2019s seal is a fine choice for a shady bed. \u2014 Matt Griswold, Fine Gardening #27. Noteworthy Characteristics These rhizomatous perennials are well suited to woodlands, naturalized areas, shady borders, and rock gardens. All parts of the plant may cause irritation if ingested. Care Grow in fertile, moist but well-drained soil ...",
