                        "datePublished": "2023-02-12T00:00:00.0000000",
                        "datePublishedDisplayText": "Feb 12, 2023",
                        "isFamilyFriendly": true,
                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenbeast.com/solomons-seal-guide",
                        "snippet": "The variegated and green species of Solomon\u2019s Seal plants are considered True Solomon\u2019s Seal. They are used in Chinese herbalism and known as \u201cyellow essence\u201d. Depending on the species, these plants can grow between 6 and 7 feet (1.8-2.1 m) tall when they reach maturity.",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-11-01T08:04:00.0000000Z",
