                        "snippet": "Variegated Solomon's Seal features dainty lightly-scented nodding white bell-shaped flowers along the stems in mid spring. Its attractive pointy leaves remain green in color with showy creamy white variegation throughout the season. The fruit is not ornamentally significant. Source Variegated Solomon\u2019s Seal #1 gallon pot in Michigan at English Gardens Nurseries and Christmas Stores ...",
                        "dateLastCrawled": "2024-10-31T23:23:00.0000000Z",
