                        "displayUrl": "https://gardenerspath.com/plants/annuals/celosia",
                        "snippet": "You\u2019ll find three general types of celosia for growing: cockscomb, wheat, and plumed. Each variety has similar requirements for growing and good plant health, but all three have wildly different appearances. Cockscomb Celosia. The most striking flower shape celosia produces, these broad and large blooms resemble coral.",
