                        "snippet": "Planting and spacing Celosia. Set Celosia 12 inches (30cm) or more inches apart. For best results, sow seed directly in the garden. Sow seed 1/8 inch deep. Seed can be started indoors in six-packs or flats; start seed in a sterile seed starting mix. Cover seed with 1/8 inch of starting mix.",
