                        "snippet": "Growing tips. Grow celosia in full sun - at least 6 to 8 hours a day. Well-drained, nutrient-rich soil keeps plants growing strong. Use a liquid plant food every couple of weeks, especially if it\u2019s been rainy or really hot: Lots of rain can wash away nutrients and temperatures above 95 degrees F slow growth.",
