                        "displayUrl": "https://www.verywellhealth.com/yarrow-health-benefits-4586386",
                        "snippet": "Medicinal Uses of Yarrow. An Herb Studied for Wound Care, Inflammation, and Menstrual Pain. Yarrow (Achillea millefolium) is a flowering perennial that grows in North America, Asia, and Europe. It has a rich history as one of the oldest plants used medicinally, with reports of its use dating back 3,000 years.",
