                        "snippet": "Cosmos is a genus in the aster family, Asteraceae, that includes approximately 30 different species. However, only three of these are commonly available for use in brightening our gardens. Let\u2019s have a look at these to see how they differ. C. atrosanguineus. C. atrosanguineus, also known as chocolate cosmos, is native to northeast Mexico.",
