                        "name": "A clump of metastatic #melanoma cells (yellow) at the centre spreading into a group of non-metastatic #cancer (cyan). For decades, there is still no drugs available to stop cancers from spreading. By understanding what drives these cells outwards, we maybe in for a chance to discover such targets for drug development! #biology #chemistry #fyp #foryou #foryoupage #fyp\u30b7 #fypage #viral #trending #PhD #STEM #university #science #research #fyp\u30b7\u309aviral #maths #physics #microscope #education",
