                        "snippet": "Other: The Pelargonium flower has a single symmetry plane (zygomorphic) which distinguishes it from the Geranium flower which is actinomorphic. Uses: Suitable as Annual. Dynamic Accumulator: Fe (Iron) Mn (Manganese) Zn (Zinc) Cu (Copper) Co (Cobalt)",
