                        "displayUrl": "https://www.ballfloraplant.com/Products/Details/?phid=028901184023074",
                        "snippet": "Compact, dark leaf. The most uniform, compact, dark-leafed zonal geranium series. Presto produces a strong first flush of flowers \u2013 3 to 4 blooms. Naturally compact habit needs no PGRs, saving you time and money. Best suited to 4 to 6-in. (10 to 15-cm) pots and 10 to 14-in. (25 to 35-cm) baskets. 'Sil Linus'. Protection Information : PP19,156.",
